# Transport Management System (TMS)

> A modern Transport Management System focused on planning, automation and fleet management.

---

# Overview

This project aims to build a scalable Transport Management System (TMS) that automates daily transport planning and administration.

The application will centralize transport orders, automatically process incoming PDF documents, organize trips, manage vehicles and maintenance, and provide a complete planning dashboard.

The system is designed with scalability and maintainability in mind, allowing new modules and services to be added over time without major architectural changes.

---

# Goals

The primary goals of this project are:

- Automate repetitive administrative tasks
- Reduce manual data entry
- Simplify transport planning
- Centralize all transport-related information
- Build a modular and maintainable platform
- Support future expansion

