# Architecture

The project follows a modular architecture.

Each major component is isolated and communicates through well-defined APIs.

Current high-level architecture:

```
                Client

                  │

             Reverse Proxy

                  │

    ┌─────────────┴─────────────┐

    │                           │

 Frontend                  Backend API

                                │

      ┌──────────────┬──────────────┬──────────────┐

      │              │              │

 PDF Parser      Email Service    Database
```

The implementation details may evolve over time.

